  "summary": "Malicious code in xbox-one-webdriver-cli (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook (postinstall.js) collects host metadata — hostname, platform, architecture, Node.js version — and POSTs it as JSON over TLS to hxxps://562mv63p[.]instances[.]poc[.]jchunt[.]top/xbox-one-webdriver-cli during npm install. The package ships a no-op bin and performs no webdriver functionality; its only behaviour is this install-time host-metadata beacon to the remote endpoint.",
